        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/tomb-raider-catalyst-trailer-crop.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Lara Croft's big comeback at the hands of Amazon has hit yet another hitch. After TV show setbacks and a delay for Tomb Raider 1 \"reimagining\" Legacy of Atlantis, Amazon's gaming boss has confirmed yet another delay: Lara's other adventure, Tomb Raider: Catalyst, now won't arrive until some time in 2028.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/tomb-raider-catalyst-delay-2028\">Read more</a></p>",
